| Path | Role |
| --- | --- |
| `src/components/` | Shared chrome (`Layout`, `Mark`, `ApiDoc`, `HeatmapOverlay`, …) |
| `src/features/experiments/` | BrowserField fleet + physics |
| `src/features/writing/` | `WritingEditor` |
| `src/features/home/` | `CreativeTextRow`, `creativeFlow.ts`, `IndexGallery`, layout helpers |
